        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 2065/2112,  Modern Rectangular Dummy Handleset with Impressa Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern design of this Weslock made handleset makes it a great choice for the front doors of contemporary homes. The rectangular mounts and flowing lines come together to form an entryset that is very striking--both elegant and beautiful. Available in either bright chrome or satin nickel finish that really accentuates its modern look. The Dummy Cylinder Modern Handleset comes with your choice of inside handle style. A dummy handleset is just for looks; it does not latch nor does it lock. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. It not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-single-cylinder-handleset-with-impressa-knob-weslock-2165-2110\"><b>Modern Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-modern-handleset-weslock-2165-2111\"><b>Modern Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction and lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Modern Dummy Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Modern Dummy Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
